{"key": "586280a3eee810eb61d830867695d25f", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Estes são os depósitos das vendas de ontem (03/11/2026). O total é R$ 814,40, em 5 vendas.\n\n- **Pix:** 1 venda, R$ 64,00. Já foi pago ontem (03/11/2026).\n- **Débito:** 2 vendas, R$ 200,50. O depósito está marcado para hoje (04/11/2026) e consta como pago.\n- **Crédito:** 2 vendas, R$ 549,90. Está agendado para 03/12/2026, daqui a 29 dias.\n\nSobre o Link de Pagamento: não tenho essa informação nos seus registros. Essa dúvida fica com outro especialista.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjTAuyzQ7GvrHK4tsY", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4266, "output_tokens": 229, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-01#0"}
{"key": "80282e713ed789dfb69d407ad337e460", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Nos últimos 7 dias, encontrei 2 vendas recusadas, somando R$ 285,00:\n\n1. **TX1007**, crédito, R$ 210,00, ontem (03/11), terminal T1988A. Código 51: saldo ou limite insuficiente no cartão do cliente. Peça outro cartão ou outra forma de pagamento.\n2. **TX1008**, débito, R$ 75,00, ontem (03/11), terminal T1988B. Código 05: transação não autorizada pelo banco emissor (genérica). O portador deve contatar o banco emissor ou tentar outro cartão.\n\nSobre as parcelas no crediário, não tenho essa informação nos seus registros.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjVs91otBjtMtZQAni", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4273, "output_tokens": 240, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "10a5edf47dc4737398409255196fcbc4", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Get Smart is an intelligent card machine. It's an Android device, so you can do more directly on it. For example, you can control stock, place orders, close tabs, load your menu, issue invoices, and exchange messages between kitchen and dining room [1][2]. You can also integrate the terminal with your establishment's system [1]. All sales made on it are processed by Getnet [2]. The offer page lists its rental at R$ 129,90/month [3].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjYUtjN6JvdWLb8HUM", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4831, "output_tokens": 145, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
{"key": "f98e8796f43d7f1c94961dd72b1c8e1d", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Get Smart is an intelligent card machine that runs Android. You can use it to control stock, place orders, close tabs, load your menu, issue invoices and exchange messages between the kitchen and dining room. You can also integrate it with your establishment's system. Getnet processes all sales made on it. The offer page lists its rental at R$ 129,90/month. Sources: sup-duvidas-get-smart-10, sup-duvidas-get-smart-17, prod-ofertas-maquininha-11.\n\nOnly one of your two terminals is online:\n- **T1988A (Get Smart):** online, on Wi-Fi with good signal. Its last contact was 2026-11-04 04:17.\n- **T1988B (Get Clássica):** offline. It uses a chip and has no signal. Its last contact was 2026-11-03 23:17, and it has been offline for 5 hours.\n\nI can propose a support ticket for T1988B. Nothing is opened until you confirm it, and the proposal expires after 15 minutes ([policy:capabilities]). Do you want me to propose it?", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjiqVYUM2EegUwsumz", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3759, "output_tokens": 352, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "parallel-02#0"}
{"key": "1bd8e0f6ab697cffbeb5382856f2cda6", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Dá para parcelar o Crediário em até 48x para o seu cliente [3][4]. O prazo máximo e a taxa de juros do parcelamento variam de acordo com o emissor do cartão [3].\n\nAntes da venda, é possível fazer uma simulação com o valor de todas as parcelas e encargos, para dar transparência ao cliente [4]. Na máquina, o caminho é: 1. CREDITO, informar o valor, 4. CREDIARIO e depois o número de parcelas [2]. Você recebe o valor da venda em até 2 dias úteis, de uma só vez, independentemente do número de parcelas [1].", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjmzVjyJvdwcRvjc7B", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4839, "output_tokens": 217, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-03#0"}
{"key": "cea7713c197769e45edc845ee50ad0a0", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O Link de Pagamento permite gerar um link para o seu cliente pagar online com cartão, Pix e débito. Ele serve para vendas por WhatsApp, redes sociais e cobranças remotas, ou para quem não tem site próprio. Você cria, envia e recebe [1].\n\n- **Formas de pagamento:** você pode deixar o comprador escolher entre débito, crédito, Pix, Wallet e boleto [4].\n- **Recursos:** é possível personalizar o link com a imagem do produto e colocar vários produtos no mesmo carrinho. Também dá para vender para estrangeiros com documento de identificação (RNE) [4].\n- **Segurança:** as transações são autenticadas pela plataforma de segurança da Getnet, e o link conta com o antifraude da Getnet [3][4].\n- **Planos:** o plano Inicial cobra R$1,00 por link pago, só quando o pagamento é aprovado. O plano Básico custa R$28 por mês e inclui 60 transações de cartão por mês, com R$0,50 por transação excedente [2].\n\nA parte sobre quando cai o dinheiro das vendas de ontem não cabe a mim aqui.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjjHHm27u7JtkytYMp", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 5093, "output_tokens": 405, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-01#0"}
{"key": "f856ed2359686e0b4548efa1afbe0162", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, in practice you need a bank account. To contract Pix at Getnet, you must enter one Pix key that is linked to the account where you want to receive payments [2]. You sign up in the Portal Minha Conta or the Getnet app, using the same key you registered with your bank account (domicílio bancário) where you'll receive Pix [5]. If you have more than one key registered on that account, choose just one to give Getnet [2].\n\nThe sources don't say which account types are accepted for receiving Pix through Getnet. They only say that Pix in general can be made through a checking account, savings account or prepaid payment account [1].\n\nMISSING: which account types Getnet accepts for receiving Pix", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUjnYjhzYmfw5Wm5iJ8", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4658, "output_tokens": 221, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "parallel-04#0"}
